# Inside Black Boxes

Supreme Court podcast + companion website. Smart, clever, opinionated commentary — not dry legal recap.

## Voice

Sharp analysis with personality. Like a smart friend explaining what happened and why it matters. Practitioner-aware but accessible.

## Stack

- Website: Vite static site in `website/`, deployed to Vercel (root dir: `website/`)
- Content: markdown in `episodes/[slug]/`, site data in `website/src/data/site.js`
- Podcast/RSS/media hosting: not yet decided — don't assume a platform

## Content workflow

`outline.md` → record → `show-notes.md` → `clips.md` → publish. Verify all quotes against official slip opinions. Note AI assistance; attorney reviews before publish.

## Episode types

Opinion drop · Oral argument debrief · Term wrap

## Conventions

- Case slugs: lowercase, hyphenated (e.g. `urias-orellana`)
- Clips: 9:16 vertical, LinkedIn-first, approval checklist in `clips.md`
- Prefer minimal, shippable changes over premature architecture
- See `AGENTS.md` for full project context
